<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Study Method Cards</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #fff4f7;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #b73868;
            background: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 18px;
        }

        .method {
            background: white;
            padding: 22px;
            margin: 18px 0;
            border-radius: 14px;
            border-left: 6px solid #b73868;
        }

        .method h2 {
            color: #b73868;
        }

        .steps {
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <h1>🧠 Study Method Cards</h1>

    <div class="method">
        <h2>📖 Active Recall</h2>
        <p>
            Try to remember information without looking at your notes.
        </p>

        <div class="steps">
            <strong>Steps:</strong>
            <ol>
                <li>Read the topic.</li>
                <li>Close your notes.</li>
                <li>Recall the main points.</li>
                <li>Check your answer.</li>
            </ol>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="method">
        <h2>🔄 Spaced Revision</h2>
        <p>
            Review information at different intervals instead of studying
            everything at once.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="method">
        <h2>🗺️ Mind Mapping</h2>
        <p>
            Organize related ideas around a central topic using branches.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="method">
        <h2>✍️ Practice Testing</h2>
        <p>
            Test yourself using questions, quizzes or previous practice material.
        </p>
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
